1
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:12,320
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,800
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:18,480
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:21,680
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:25,800
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:29,280
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:32,200
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:35,400
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:39,400
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:42,600
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:45,320
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:48,680
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:59,000
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:00,400
=Episode 17=

15
00:01:01,799 --> 00:01:02,520
What's wrong, Immortal Venerable?

16
00:01:11,159 --> 00:01:12,319
This is the Heavenly Mystic Robe.

17
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:14,359
It's impervious to fire and water.
It's yours.

18
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:15,799
Put it on before you leave.

19
00:01:27,159 --> 00:01:27,760
Where do I change?

20
00:01:28,359 --> 00:01:29,120
Right here.

21
00:01:30,159 --> 00:01:31,760
If you go out dressed like this,

22
00:01:32,159 --> 00:01:34,319
won't it make us a laughingstock?

23
00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:38,079
All right.

24
00:01:38,760 --> 00:01:40,439
Then please give me some privacy.

25
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:42,799
Interesting.

26
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,480
Are you shy?

27
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:48,120
Fine.

28
00:02:29,159 --> 00:02:30,240
This boy

29
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:31,759
will surely go far.

30
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:33,800
Eldest Senior Sister,

31
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,840
that handsome guy is pretty good, huh?

32
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:38,000
You like him too?

33
00:02:38,479 --> 00:02:39,560
You think I'm like you?

34
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:41,400
I don't care.

35
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:44,080
If we ever use him
as a cultivation vessel

36
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:45,680
for dual cultivation,
let me have a taste first.

37
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:46,960
Then you can have your turn.

38
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:48,439
Cut the nonsense,

39
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:49,919
or I'll have the Golden Monkey bite you!

40
00:02:50,599 --> 00:02:51,240
No, no!

41
00:02:52,319 --> 00:02:53,159
One bite from it

42
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:55,680
will leave you hurting for hours.

43
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:01,319
His comprehension is exceptional.

44
00:03:01,919 --> 00:03:02,960
According to him,

45
00:03:03,719 --> 00:03:05,360
he can complete a minor circulation

46
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:07,639
of his cultivation art in one breath.

47
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,360
In one breath?

48
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:10,439
That's...

49
00:03:11,599 --> 00:03:13,479
that's unbelievable.

50
00:03:14,439 --> 00:03:16,599
But he doesn't seem like one to brag.

51
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:19,560
Records say

52
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:21,759
the first cultivators
of Shenwu Continent

53
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:24,800
date back a hundred thousand years.

54
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:28,879
Now its spiritual energy
is increasingly scarce.

55
00:03:30,479 --> 00:03:31,360
I have a feeling

56
00:03:32,319 --> 00:03:33,400
the great tribulation is coming.

57
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:36,159
We must restart the continent

58
00:03:36,319 --> 00:03:37,400
to restore its spiritual energy.

59
00:03:37,719 --> 00:03:38,400
Otherwise,

60
00:03:38,879 --> 00:03:40,479
even True Immortals like us

61
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:41,840
may not survive.

62
00:03:43,039 --> 00:03:45,240
The Heavenly Dao runs in cycles.
The great tribulation is coming.

63
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:46,759
There's no escaping it.

64
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:49,360
We just happened to live in this era.

65
00:03:51,319 --> 00:03:52,560
But somehow,

66
00:03:53,479 --> 00:03:55,319
doesn't the Heavenly Dao
always leave a way out?

67
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:57,080
A way out?

68
00:03:58,159 --> 00:03:59,280
Where is the way out?

69
00:03:59,639 --> 00:04:01,080
It's so hard to find.

70
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:03,960
We've lived for over a thousand years,

71
00:04:04,599 --> 00:04:06,520
yet haven't found
a single Dao companion.

72
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:08,039
Are we really

73
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:10,639
going to perish
in this great tribulation

74
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:13,280
and become nourishment
for heaven and earth?

75
00:04:16,639 --> 00:04:17,199
Darn.

76
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:18,199
Getting here

77
00:04:18,639 --> 00:04:20,040
took us ten days drifting at sea.

78
00:04:20,199 --> 00:04:22,000
We nearly capsized several times.

79
00:04:24,279 --> 00:04:26,000
Will we run into Zhao Feiyang again?

80
00:04:26,839 --> 00:04:27,680
Someone brought him in.

81
00:04:27,839 --> 00:04:28,920
He must've been here for some time.

82
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:29,759
Don't mention him!

83
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:31,439
Just hearing that brat makes me mad.

84
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:32,639
If I ever run into him again,

85
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:33,839
I'll kill him myself!

86
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,319
And this island

87
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,360
isn't hospitable at all!

88
00:04:36,959 --> 00:04:38,360
We're prodigies, after all.

89
00:04:38,759 --> 00:04:39,959
Yet no one even came to greet us!

90
00:04:40,279 --> 00:04:41,959
Jiang Cheng,
this is Sword Immortal Island.

91
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,000
Watch your mouth.

92
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:44,040
Can't I even complain?

93
00:04:44,199 --> 00:04:45,040
If we weren't here to learn,

94
00:04:45,199 --> 00:04:46,120
who'd come to this dump...?

95
00:04:54,279 --> 00:04:55,680
Greetings, Immortal Venerables.

96
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:56,839
Greetings, Immortal Venerables.

97
00:04:57,519 --> 00:04:59,199
The most talented one has left.

98
00:04:59,519 --> 00:05:00,439
Is there any point

99
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:01,959
wasting our time on them?

100
00:05:02,120 --> 00:05:03,399
We can't let them
come all this way for nothing.

101
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:06,000
We still have to show
the major factions some respect.

102
00:05:08,519 --> 00:05:09,199
Rise.

103
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:11,000
Thank you, Immortal Venerables!

104
00:05:11,079 --> 00:05:11,600
Thank you, Immortal Venerables!

105
00:05:11,639 --> 00:05:12,759
Thank you, Immortal Venerables!

106
00:05:17,199 --> 00:05:18,839
The five of you came here
to seek instruction.

107
00:05:19,319 --> 00:05:20,560
Unfortunately,

108
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:22,680
we don't have much time
to spend teaching you.

109
00:05:23,439 --> 00:05:24,480
How far you go

110
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:25,959
will depend on yourselves.

111
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:28,360
We await your guidance,
Immortal Venerables!

112
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:32,879
I didn't expect to see an old friend.

113
00:05:37,519 --> 00:05:38,839
If you want it back,

114
00:05:40,959 --> 00:05:42,279
I will gladly return it.

115
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:44,680
Since it's yours now,

116
00:05:44,879 --> 00:05:45,720
it was meant to be.

117
00:05:46,839 --> 00:05:47,560
Keep it.

118
00:05:50,439 --> 00:05:51,519
Thank you, Immortal Venerable Canglan.

119
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:24,000
That's a Heaven-Mending Stone,

120
00:06:24,439 --> 00:06:25,600
the hardest material in existence.

121
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,839
Yet a single sword strike
actually left marks on it.

122
00:06:32,439 --> 00:06:33,000
All right.

123
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:34,600
Go study these marks.

124
00:06:35,079 --> 00:06:35,639
Sword Immortals,

125
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:37,800
what do these three marks mean?

126
00:06:38,319 --> 00:06:39,120
The Dao gives birth to One.

127
00:06:39,319 --> 00:06:40,120
One gives birth to Two.

128
00:06:40,279 --> 00:06:41,079
Two gives birth to Three.

129
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,399
Three gives birth to all things.

130
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:44,079
These three marks

131
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:46,279
contain our lifelong sword intent.

132
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:48,000
You have seven days.

133
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,399
As for what you can learn

134
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,519
from these marks,

135
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:53,319
that depends on your fortune.

136
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:56,879
Looks like these three marks

137
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:59,000
contain the ultimate Sword Dao.

138
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:03,160
I see.

139
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:04,800
Thanks for your guidance,
Immortal Venerable!

140
00:07:05,519 --> 00:07:06,519
Thanks for your guidance,
Immortal Venerable!

141
00:07:06,639 --> 00:07:07,480
Thank you, Immortal Venerable!

142
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:23,040
We shouldn't just sit around.

143
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:24,160
Let's enter secluded cultivation.

144
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:25,680
Secluded cultivation again?

145
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:26,800
How boring.

146
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:29,959
First, to prevent the demon race
from invading again.

147
00:07:30,759 --> 00:07:31,360
Second,

148
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,879
to find a way
to face the great tribulation.

149
00:07:34,879 --> 00:07:36,079
When the Heavenly Dao's
great tribulation comes,

150
00:07:36,639 --> 00:07:37,800
all things are but straw dogs.

151
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:39,639
However advanced our cultivation,

152
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:41,480
how could we resist it?

153
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:44,360
Why don't we travel around for now

154
00:07:44,759 --> 00:07:46,240
and enjoy the scenery?

155
00:07:46,879 --> 00:07:48,319
Do you want to see the scenery

156
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:49,839
or handsome men?

157
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:52,800
Senior Sister,

158
00:07:53,319 --> 00:07:55,160
if you see through someone,
don't say it out loud.

159
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:56,439
Don't you know that?

160
00:07:58,759 --> 00:08:00,240
In the face of the great tribulation,

161
00:08:00,439 --> 00:08:03,160
we're as powerless as ants.

162
00:08:03,759 --> 00:08:05,439
But we can't just wait
for the axe to fall.

163
00:08:07,079 --> 00:08:08,160
You're right, Second Senior Sister.

164
00:08:09,519 --> 00:08:10,000
Let's go.

165
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:17,079
I'm finally off the island.

166
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:19,080
It's time to throw those leeches

167
00:08:19,080 --> 00:08:19,920
out of our home.

168
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:23,959
I'm so used to being poor

169
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:25,879
that I actually planned to walk.

170
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:27,879
I may be at the
Minor Perfection Realm now,

171
00:08:28,759 --> 00:08:30,079
but it'd still take
twenty or thirty days

172
00:08:30,319 --> 00:08:31,360
to get back on foot.

173
00:08:32,840 --> 00:08:35,600
Better spend some spirit crystals
to take a cloudship.

174
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,240
What the hell?

175
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:17,879
To whoever set up this Maze Formation,

176
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:19,320
I wandered in by mistake.

177
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:21,360
Please let me through.

178
00:09:25,159 --> 00:09:26,120
In that case...

179
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:39,159
A piece of cake.

180
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:43,759
Ah, good wine!

181
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:49,399
Heavenly Mystic Robe?

182
00:09:59,080 --> 00:09:59,879
Do you really have to do this?

183
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:01,120
What choice do I have?

184
00:10:01,559 --> 00:10:02,360
You little brat!

185
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:05,480
You drained my spirit vein
and think you can just walk away?

186
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:06,919
What else could I do?

187
00:10:07,039 --> 00:10:08,440
Wait around for you to come after me?

188
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:11,320
Fair enough.

189
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:13,480
But did you really think

190
00:10:13,639 --> 00:10:15,879
you could get away from me?

191
00:10:16,639 --> 00:10:18,679
So there's no room for negotiation?

192
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:19,559
There is,

193
00:10:19,879 --> 00:10:21,000
of course.

194
00:10:22,639 --> 00:10:24,399
All you have to do is pay

195
00:10:24,519 --> 00:10:25,799
two million spirit crystals.

196
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:27,039
Then you're free to go.

197
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:28,600
Two million spirit crystals?

198
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:30,279
Why don't you just rob me?

199
00:10:30,799 --> 00:10:31,559
Besides,

200
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:33,159
you already extorted so much

201
00:10:33,279 --> 00:10:33,960
from those five.

202
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:34,960
Why are you coming after me too?

203
00:10:35,759 --> 00:10:36,320
Well...

204
00:10:37,559 --> 00:10:39,039
You really have no shame!

205
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,200
Those five

206
00:10:40,399 --> 00:10:42,360
were merely taking the blame for you.

207
00:10:42,559 --> 00:10:44,399
Your debt is a separate matter,
isn't it?

208
00:10:45,919 --> 00:10:47,639
(This old man is definitely powerful.)

209
00:10:48,159 --> 00:10:48,960
(I won't get the better of him.)

210
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:52,759
Senior,

211
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:55,080
two million is too much.

212
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:56,639
I can't come up with that much now.

213
00:10:56,799 --> 00:10:57,320
A hundred thousand.

214
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:59,039
A hundred thousand spirit crystals.

215
00:10:59,519 --> 00:11:00,679
I can barely afford that.

216
00:11:00,980 --> 00:11:01,400
Huh?

217
00:11:02,039 --> 00:11:02,540
Really?

218
00:11:02,540 --> 00:11:02,840
Yep.

219
00:11:03,159 --> 00:11:04,840
I remember

220
00:11:05,559 --> 00:11:07,000
your storage ring

221
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:08,320
held plenty of spirit crystals,

222
00:11:08,519 --> 00:11:11,039
along with lots of treasures
and magic boxes.

223
00:11:11,559 --> 00:11:12,320
Put them all together

224
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:14,720
and they're worth well over two million.

225
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:16,279
Did you lose them?

226
00:11:20,679 --> 00:11:22,039
Looks like I was right.

227
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:22,879
Come on.

228
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:24,799
Hand them over.

229
00:11:26,159 --> 00:11:27,600
(His divine sense is powerful.)

230
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:29,399
(He can actually project
his divine sense)

231
00:11:29,559 --> 00:11:31,080
(into my storage ring.)

232
00:11:31,799 --> 00:11:33,440
(Am I really going to
hand it all over like this?)

233
00:11:35,679 --> 00:11:37,200
What if I can't give it to you?

234
00:11:37,559 --> 00:11:38,480
What do you mean, can't?

235
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:41,320
You mean you won't, right?

236
00:11:41,960 --> 00:11:44,840
Then I'll take it myself!

237
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:55,600
♪I once stood on high,
drawing spiritual energy into my blade♪

238
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:58,600
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

239
00:11:58,840 --> 00:12:02,240
♪Then came my fall,
with frost and snow on my shoulders♪

240
00:12:02,560 --> 00:12:06,160
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

241
00:12:07,160 --> 00:12:10,440
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

242
00:12:10,760 --> 00:12:13,520
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

243
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:17,040
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

244
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:21,200
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

245
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:25,200
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

246
00:12:25,640 --> 00:12:28,680
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

247
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:31,920
♪With this flesh and soul♪

248
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:35,280
♪I shall forge a new age♪

249
00:12:35,680 --> 00:12:38,560
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

250
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:42,000
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

251
00:12:42,440 --> 00:12:44,560
♪At cultivation's peak♪

252
00:12:45,040 --> 00:12:47,280
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

253
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:51,680
♪The sun and moon turn♪

254
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:55,080
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

255
00:12:55,800 --> 00:13:00,560
♪I am the undying flame♪

256
00:13:03,280 --> 00:13:07,000
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

257
00:13:08,360 --> 00:13:10,320
♪At last I see, immortality♪

258
00:13:11,640 --> 00:13:15,080
♪Lives in your smiles♪
